```json
{
  "name": "find",
  "arguments": {
    "path": "Quarter1_Reports",
    "name": "*.txt"
  }
}
```

(Note: After receiving the list of `.txt` files from the `find` command, you would iterate over each filename and call `cp` to copy it into `Archived_Quarter1`. Each `cp` call would look like this:)

```json
{
  "name": "cp",
  "arguments": {
    "source": "Quarter1_Reports/FILE_NAME.txt",
    "destination": "Archived_Quarter1/FILE_NAME.txt"
  }
}
```
